            "review_title": "Review at Quan Hay Restaurant",
            "review_text": "thle2016\nBoston, Massachusetts5 contributions\n0\nAmazing Vietnamese cuisines, charming staffs.\nJul 2016 • Friends\nI came here with three friends of mine for the lunch. We tried some spring rolls and fish dishes. They were tasty. We enjoyed foods and warm space on the 2nd floor with large glass window to look down the street. The manager stopped by to talk with us. He was very nice guy. I do recommend you to try traditional spring rolls, fresh spring rolls and fried minced fish with dill.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 23, 2016\namthucdongquequanhay\nDear thle2016, \nThanks you so much for your comment as well as your time for us. We're so glad to hear that and hope to serve you soon in the restaurant. Wish you success and happiness.\nPS: We promise make a special \"Quan HAY\" spring roll for you :)\nRead more\nWritten July 25, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
