            "review_text": "Tung N\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat restaurant\nApr 2016 • Friends\nCame here several times and love the traditional vietnamese cuisine and decoration at this restaurant. They also serve new dishes every time I come. If you are not so sure what you want to taste, just ask for recommendations from the owner. Second floor offers you a better view.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 5, 2016\namthucdongquequanhay\nDear Tung N, thank you so much for your comment and we hope we have more chance to serve you more times in the future. Wish you success and happiness in life :)\nRead more\nWritten July 7, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
